cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "BiologicalClockOfMultimorbidity"
abstract: >-
  Interactive Shiny application accompanying "The biological clock of
  multimorbidity: temporal dynamics of disease co-occurrence in primary
  care" -- lets users explore comorbidity networks, sex-stratified
  comparisons, and their evolution across follow-up windows.
